 = ROUTE_EN & ADDR3. Addresses 000..111 select S1..S8." (at 20.32 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 62ba011e-afab-5821-9521-19cb7e4e1a4a))(text "Dedicated return: external contact -> RETURN_LOAD -> existing monitor 2 ohm shunt -> RETURN_DRIVER -> current-driver B_BR." (at 20.32 307.34 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid c031a637-f246-5e5e-a712-2509d9b3b107))(text "Do not bypass the monitor, add a second shunt, tie the two returns, or use recording REF/BIAS as a stimulation return." (at 20.32 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 0b6601c9-0b7f-5ee2-9905-efcdd84846ae))(text "TMUX6208 is rail-to-rail at valid 24 V supply; powered-off, stuck-on, parasitic coupling and two-source shared tissue paths remain unqualified." (at 20.32 322.58 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid d366cc94-547e-564e-b90c-75fc638cd0d9))(text "A_ROUTER needs external terminal guard qualification before connection to A_BR. Internal enable-low is only a commanded off state." (at 20.32 330.2 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid c8ce2cd6-6d56-5271-b119-7a8eded4321f)))
